 branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Mykyta Svyrydenko\n\nStatus:\n(clean)\n\nRecent commits:\nf860ff3 codex: bash-tool-result cell supported, recorded in runs/shell-exit-status (#91)\nbd7e1e2 rules: a recording outranks a doc; partial support is supported with deviations; unsupported may be shown by runs (#90)\ncfd2711 rules: judge per unit (subjects), module.yaml is the agent's, module-distinct (#89)\nd27fac9 capabilities: a false cell needs evidence; add pending for not-yet-mocked (#87)\n4f35b85 ci: pin sr-checks at sloprail main (Stop perf, RepoID, snapshot leaks: #179, #185) (#88)\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5206b5b2ad4bea59","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"claude/capabilities-matrix-impl-2a0cfd"}
