{"parentUuid":"53e70266-c7da-4b55-adb8-bd5ca005bbb3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b8557a2-9430-4f17-946a-1ea07dab5643","agentId":"a5206b5b2ad4bea59","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011no11URgM99TuN3vGZCtAs","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5206b5b2ad4bea59\nf860ff3 codex: bash-tool-result cell supported, recorded in runs/shell-exit-status (#91)\nbd7e1e2 rules: a recording outranks a doc; partial support is supported with deviations; unsupported may be shown by runs (#90)\ncfd2711 rules: judge per unit (subjects), module.yaml is the agent's, module-distinct (#89)\nstatement: >-\n  In a non-interactive run, the session stays open until its background sub-\n  agents finish, and each one's completion starts a further turn.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/headless#background-tasks-at-exit\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgagent\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\ncommit f860ff366b50328d62a3ff06a1cd76d39e84245f\nAuthor: Mykyta Svyrydenko <<redacted-email>>\nDate:   Sat Oct 3 16:44:15 2026 +0200\n\n    codex: bash-tool-result cell supported, recorded in runs/shell-exit-status (#91)\n    \n    Codex tells the agent a failed command's output like a success's; the failure is only in the event stream's command_execution item (status failed, exit_code). Recorded with the real codex; the cell lists that as a deviation, and the mock does the same.\n    \n    Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/shell_result_test.go      | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n codex-mock/internal/events/stream.go               |  7 ++-\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/run.yaml      |  2 +\n .../shell-exit-status/samples/20261003-142833/SEAL |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/events.jsonl           | 22 +++++++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/exit.txt               |  1 +\n .../sampl