{"parentUuid":"fdf8f9d9-1074-4b04-a511-e54d1a10759a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"a5206b5b2ad4bea59","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VELDF97UMcmaaz2w5XUU9u","type":"tool_result","content":"213:the following rules refused this work:\nthe following rules refused this work:\n  - The statement covers the working directory, and every recorded tool-hook payload carries \"cwd\":\"\" (preToolUse, beforeShellExecution, postToolUseFailure), but no test asserts the cwd field. TestEveryHookPayloadNamesTheSessionTheTranscriptAndTheWorkspace checks session_id, conversation_id, workspace_roots and transcript_path only, and it also does not check the user_email:null, cursor_version or generation_id fields the docs list as common. The sub-agent part is covered by the modeled-surface deviation.\n  - The headless doc (#how-it-works, lines 9-27) says print mode without --force/--yolo only proposes changes and does not modify files, while with --force it applies them. The mock only accepts and ignores --force/--yolo (cursor-mock/root.go:42-43, 'accepted, ignored'). The modeled-surface deviation does not declare this, and no test runs with and without --force to check what happens to file changes. Add a test and a recorded run for it, or declare a deviation.\n  - TestAfterAToolSucceedsTheHookGetsItsInputItsOutputAndHowLongItTook replays only the file-tools run (Write and Read), so the Shell success postToolUse recorded in tool-failure and pretool-refusal (tool_input {command,timeout}, tool_output {\"output\":\"FINE\n  - Cursor docs say preToolUse fires and can deny for every tool type (Shell, Read, Write, MCP, Task), and the mock refuses non-Shell tools (toolhost.go:46, background_agent.go:57), but every refusal test uses only Shell commands, so no test checks refusing a file tool or Task and no recorded run shows it.\ndone","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"794faea8-cdf8-451e-8f5d-f08c3775e712","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:54:15.944Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fdf8f9d9-1074-4b04-a511-e54d1a10759a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5206b5b2ad4bea59","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a7e54ea3099505a7e"}
